## Usage with Claude Desktop

Add to `claude_desktop_config.json`:

```json
{
  "mcpServers": {
    "{{projectName}}": {
      "command": "node",
      "args": ["/path/to/{{projectName}}/dist/index.js"]
    }
  }
}
```
